===Etymology 1===
{{ety|en|:af|googly|-le<id:frequentative>|id=cricket|tree=1}}
{{back-formation|en|googly}}<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''v.''{{sup|1}}|noformat=1|id=80010|date=September 2018}}</ref> + {{m|en|-le|pos={{glossary|frequentative}} {{glossary|suffix}} (indicating continuousness or repetition) forming {{glossary|verb}}s}}.

====Verb====
{{en-verb}} {{tlb|en|cricket}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[bowl#Verb|bowl]] (a [[cricket ball]]) so that it [[perform]]s a {{l|en|googly|t=a [[ball#Noun|ball]] by a [[leg break|leg-break]] [[bowler]] that [[spin#Verb|spins]] from [[off#Noun|off]] to [[leg#Noun|leg]] (to a [[right-handed]] [[batsman]]), [[unlike]] a [[normal#Adjective|normal]] leg-break [[delivery]]}}.
# {{lb|en|intransitive}}
## Of a bowler: to bowl or [[deliver]] a googly.
## Of a cricket ball: to [[move#Verb|move]] as in a googly.

