===Etymology 2===
[[File:Google Homepage.svg|thumb|A [[screenshot#Noun|screenshot]] of the {{w|Google Search}} [[home page]].]]
{{ety|en|:from|Google|id=search engine}}
From {{m|en|Google|t=search engine operated by {{w|Google|Google LLC}}}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|entry=Google|pos=''v.''{{sup|2}}|noformat=1|id=261961|date=March 2022}}</ref><ref>{{R:Lexico|pos=v}}</ref>

====Noun====
{{en-noun}} {{tlb|en|Internet|informal}}

# An [[Internet]] [[search#Noun|search]], such as one [[perform]]ed on the [[Google]] [[search engine]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2023|author={{w|Isabella Hammad}}|title=Enter Ghost|publisher=Jonathan Cape|page=51|passage=Each night I allowed myself one desultory '''google''' before leaping to my feet for a lamplit walk around the neighbourhood.}}
# {{lb|en|dated}} A [[match#Noun|match]] [[obtain]]ed by a [[query#Noun|query]] in the Google search engine.
#: {{syn|en|[[Google]] [[hit]]|ghit}}
#: {{hyper|en|hit|result}}
#: {{ux|en|The word ''{{l|en|oceanfront}}'' has 64,300,000 '''googles''', so I think it must be a real word.}}

